      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Interestingly, although the errors remained (the SDK is still complaining about the weight), the avatar itself loaded.\n\nUPD. As far as I understand, this is a bug that can be fixed by uploading the avatar to another platform and then switching back to this platform. It's a bit complicated, but after doing this, the SDK doesn't seem to be complaining anymore.",
