  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When setting up your avatar for the quest and iOS, I encountered a problem. When I attempted to upload the avatar, it was not possible due to the SDK not allowing me to upload the asset. The SDK claimed that the texture size of my avatar exceeded 40MB. However, prior to setting up the avatar, I ensured that this was not the case (as shown in the screenshot below). Additionally, I noticed that when adjusting the resolution and other settings, the weight parameters of the avatar did not change. I am unsure of how to proceed with this issue.",
